#: processes/content-lifecycle.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "folio-assistant — the content lifecycle end to end, one cycle of a folio. Source of truth: this file. Open it in bpmn.io, Camunda Modeler, or any other BPMN 2.0 tool. The SVG under docs/assets/img/workflows/ is generated from it by `bun run render:bpmn` — never hand-edit the SVG. The <folio:skill> extension on an activity names the folio-assistant skill that implements it; <folio:bean> marks a step that reads or writes the shared work plan in beans/."
msgstr ""

